 "text": "Fertilizers - Bartlett\nFertilizers - Bartlett\nSkip to main content\nContact Us\nGrain\nCash Bids\nFertilizers\nRenewable Fuels\nPricing Programs\nMilling\nFood Safety\nMilling Locations\nProcessing\nAbout\nCompany\nSuppliers\nNews\nLocations\nCareers\nGraduates\nInternships\nSustainability\nCustomer Portal\nBartlett\n-->\nContact Us\nGrain\nCash Bids\nFertilizers\nRenewable Fuels\nPricing Programs\nMilling\nFood Safety\nMilling Locations\nProcessing\nAbout\nCompany\nSuppliers\nNews\nLocations\nCareers\nGraduates\nInternships\nSustainability\nCustomer Portal\nBartlett\nGrain\nFertilizers\nBartlett provides a full line of liquid and dry fertilizer products as well as anhydrous ammonia and micronutrients. Our primary emphasis is delivering your product when you need it. We utilize our dedicated, in-house truck logistics group to provide excellent on-time delivery of your product.\nWith over 114 years of commodity position risk management experience, Bartlett fertilizer traders will gladly discuss factors that are influencing fertilizer price movements.\nProducts We Trade\nBartlett offers wholesale nitrogen, phosphates and potassium fertilizers, including:\nAnhydrous ammonia (NH3)\nLiquid urea ammonium nitrate (UAN)\nPotash\nMonoammonium phosphate (MAP)\nDiammonium phosphate (DAP)\nWe also handle a wide variety of micronutrient products and custom blends. Contact us for details.\nFertilizer Logistics Services\nWe have an extensive logistics footprint allowing us to move product quickly and easily; and paired with our industry relationships with fertilizer suppliers and producers, we can offer product where you need it and when you need it.\nContact us for more information on how we can best fit your needs.\nLearn More\nFind out how we can help meet your fertilizer needs. Contact us to learn more about pickup and delivery.\nContact Us\nCopyright © 2026 Bartlett, a Savage Company. Privacy Policy",
